If you run a modified version of nerdui and let users interact with it over a
network, you must offer them the corresponding source code (AGPL-3.0 section 13).
nerdui shows a "Source code" link in the UI and in /api/v1/version for this
purpose; point it to your source by building with:
  -ldflags "-X github.com/pessom/nerdui/internal/version.Source=<your-repo-url>"

